# Fundamentals of Programming (5K7V0027)
#
# This repository holds the two prototype deliverables only. The planning
# documents and the assessment brief live alongside them in the working folder
# but are deliberately not published, so everything at the repository root is
# ignored by default and the two project folders are added back explicitly.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/betterment_prototype/
!/betterment_notebook/

